OL,3,GNEWSA#5m revamp for 'ageing' renal and
OL,4,Agynaecology units
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has announced a #5.6m
OL,7,Fredevelopment of its ageing renal and
OL,8,Fgynaecology units.
OL,10,FThe West Cumberland Hospital in
OL,11,FWhitehaven will receive the funding
OL,12,Ffrom NHS England, with work expected to
OL,13,Fstart "as soon as contracts are in
OL,14,Fplace".
OL,16,FNorth Cumbria Integrated Care NHS
OL,17,FFoundation Trust (NCIC), which runs the
OL,18,Fhospital, said the current renal unit
OL,19,Fand women's outpatient department no
OL,20,Flonger met "the standards expected of a
OL,21,Fmodern healthcare facility".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
