OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1791287796
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA#5m revamp for 'ageing' renal and
OL,4,Agynaecology units
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said "limited space and ageing
OL,7,Finfrastructure" could affect capacity
OL,8,Fand service delivery and the renal unit
OL,9,Fcould not meet "rising demand for
OL,10,Fhaemodialysis" - a type of treatment to
OL,11,Fhelp patients with failing kidneys.
